[00:04.08] Nameless as the way we started
[00:06.56] I'd like to go
[01:26.02] Back to time before name
[01:31.22] Name for all we know
[01:36.06] When the room was filled with chances
[01:41.26] No one would take
[01:46.32] We collided with them
[01:50.78] Knowing chances fade
[01:55.36] Proving that to keep from hiding
[02:00.72] Means you must play on a nerve
[02:09.58] Under the weight of skin and bone
[02:20.36] Dotted lines divide
[02:27.02] The shape of things to come
[02:35.14] Giving up anticipation
[02:40.22] For certainty
[02:45.22] Wasn't nearly as good
[02:49.72] As we hoped it'd be
[02:54.68] Pulling back the sheets and covers
[02:59.62] Only to find
[03:04.78] The freight and baggage that grows
[03:09.48] On the family tree
[03:14.38] If loving only comes with effort
[03:19.48] Could we still be on a nerve
[03:29.20] Under the weight of skin and bone
[03:38.72] Dotted lines divide
[03:46.32] The shape of things to come
[03:56.14] Feeling on the edge of being
[04:18.50] Taken aback
[04:23.74] By the damage we did
[04:28.60] With the sense we lack
[04:33.42] Thieving over intonation
[04:38.68] Tuning at last on a nerve
[04:49.00] Under the weight of skin and bone
[04:58.90] Dotted lines divide
[05:06.34] The shape of things to come
